  <item>
    <title>38| 【年终总结之叁】同频的人，是最好的礼物</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675be37d84447b1bd0961ef8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675be37d84447b1bd0961ef8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Dec 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>吾门冉求（一位常常瞎说大真话的woman）</span></p><span></span><p><span>吾门子鱼（一位常常真说大瞎话的woman）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 和播播们的关系：被听到的同频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 哇！吾门毫不费力的坚持周更播客大半年了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> 子鱼与伴侣的“不吵-大吵特吵-有效沟通”耗时4年有余</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 亲密关系中不吵架不代表是同频的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> “情绪稳定”也不是代表毫无需求和情绪，或许是不会表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> 人到中年，同频的朋友愈发难得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 同频不等于同样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a>人的独特性在于：我们不一样，就像五线谱一样，高高低低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 相似的人反而不一定能同频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 同频的关系是可以接得住双方的攻击性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 如果对方说了“你需要改”，这段关系还同频吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">45:44</a> 关系它是流动的</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐使用苹果系统自带【播客】APP、【小宇宙】APP或任意安卓播客客户端订阅收听《吾门不主义》，也可通过【网易云音乐】收听，吾门每周二固定更新。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmdLkVS2v_Czt7X4nRT8eLSC3AG7.m4a" length="54785195" type="audio/mp4"/>
